Neon spaces (M2), part 3 of 5: model filter.

Keeps keyboard tab navigation inside the visible space, the way tab group
focus mode does for the focused group: next and previous tab, Helium's MRU
cycling, Ctrl+1..9, the tab activated after a close, and close other tabs,
close tabs to the right and Helium's close tabs to the left. One call each
into neon::spaces::IsTabHidden.

